   surface with punctures admits a cocompact classifying space for proper
   actions of dimension equal to its virtual cohomological dimension. This
   was proved for closed orientable surfaces and for pure mapping class
   groups by Aramayona and Mart \& iacute;nez P \& eacute;rez. As a
   consequence of our result, we also obtain the proper geometric dimension
   of full spherical braid groups.},
